  "id": "interaction-effect",
  "term": "interaction effect",
  "definition": "An interaction effect is when the effect of an intervention changes depending on a group characteristic or other key variable. In this source, testing an interaction effect means examining whether treatment effects differ between groups, such as across racial groups.",
